# Equilibrium League drop rules (wiki Other rules / upgradable items on tables).
# https://runescape.wiki/w/Equilibrium_League
#
# - Rex Matriarchs: full Fremennik upgraded rings instead of hearts
# - Elite Dungeon 2 (Dragonkin Laboratory): Draconic energy + Tectonic energy
# - Elite Dungeon 1 (Temple of Aminishi): Ancient scales + Sirenic scales
#
# Item self-supply for rings is already anachronia-only (2026-08-02-anachronia-rings).
# This patch surfaces the league drops on content majors, boss faces, and effects.

